@* A skeleton the SERVER renders is never seen: static SSR finishes
   OnInitializedAsync before a byte exists. The one a user sees comes from Unpoly's
   [up-placeholder], which fills the target the moment the request leaves — so skeletons live in
   a <template> in the layout, not in the page they stand in for. *@
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
    <Skeleton Class="size-12 rounded-full" />
    <div class="space-y-2">
        <Skeleton Class="h-4 w-[220px]" />
        <Skeleton Class="h-4 w-[160px]" />
    </div>
</div>
